# N9: e1m1's computer corridor, between its two ambient hums, eased forward over the shot
# ("id's mixer runs at"). Slop at 1920x1080, no status bar. The film's sound here is not
# this shot's: see film/README.md.

map e1m1

duration 10.2
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 1.0  480,120,110  10,90  ease inout
key 9.2  480,180,110  0,90

sound on
events on
